	(descr "Bourns PEC11R incremental encoder with push switch, vertical, PC pins (PEC11R-4215F-S0024). From https://www.bourns.com/docs/Product-Datasheets/PEC11R.pdf: A-C-B order, 2.5 mm pitch, switch pins 5.0 apart, 5x dia 1.0 holes; rows 7.5 / 7.0 from the shaft and lug positions match the official EC11E footprint (PEC11R is EC11-footprint compatible). Lug slot 2.2x2.8 accepts lug spacing 10.9-11.2. Print 1:1 and test-fit before ordering.")
